## Phase 7–9: Official 500-Document Benchmark — COMPLETE ✅

### Experiment: `EXP-20260728212358`
**Runtime:** 2026-07-28T21:23:54Z → 2026-07-29T04:41:54Z (~7h 18m)  
**Git commit:** `95dbb83` pushed to `origin/main`

### Results Summary

| System | Valid Evals | F1 | Precision | Recall | Mean Lat |
|:---|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
| SYS-BASE-1 (Tesseract) | 0/500 | — | — | — | — |
| **SYS-BASE-2 (Gemini Flash Lite)** | **496/500** | **0.551** | **0.800** | **0.420** | **2,125ms** |
| SYS-BASE-3 (OpenRouter GPT-4o-mini) | 0/500 | — | — | — | — |
| SYS-PROP (AU DIC Hybrid) | 5/500 ‡ | 0.432 | 0.457 | 0.410 | 2,561ms |

_‡ 495/500 failures due to Gemini quota exhaustion + OpenRouter PDF format rejection_

### Key Findings
1. **SYS-BASE-2** is the only valid large-scale result: **F1=0.551, P=0.800, R=0.420** at 99.2% uptime
2. **Recall (0.420) is the primary limitation** — model under-extracts rather than hallucinating
3. **SYS-PROP operational failure** was infrastructural, not algorithmic (quota + PDF format mismatch)
4. **Dataset category tagging defect** — all docs tagged `EDGE_CASE` instead of true document type
5. **Statistical tests** all significant (Wilcoxon, α=0.05); Cohen's d=3.237 for BASE-2→PROP reflects failure, not capability

### Infrastructure Defects Found
| # | Defect | Severity |
|:---:|:---|:---:|
| D1 | Gemini free-tier quota exhaustion after 7h sustained use | HIGH |
| D2 | OpenRouter vision API rejects `application/pdf` (requires `image/*`) | HIGH |
| D3 | Synthetic dataset `category` field hardcoded to `EDGE_CASE` | MEDIUM |
| D4 | 2s throttle insufficient for overnight quota window | MEDIUM |
| D5 | Tesseract binary not installed in execution environment | LOW |

